WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.666
They take it so seriously,
他们对赛车极其认真，

00:00:01.666 --> 00:00:03.133
whereas in Europe and America,
而在欧洲和美国，

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:05.366
you get the sense that it's all part of a lifestyle.
赛车对很多人而言更像是一种生活方式。

00:00:05.366 --> 00:00:07.533
They want to experience the life of a racing driver.
他们想体验职业车手的生活，

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:08.666
They want to wear the right watch.
想戴一块体面的腕表，

00:00:08.666 --> 00:00:10.333
They want to hang out with the right drivers.
想与圈内的车手交往，

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:11.666
They want to dine well,
想品尝美食，

00:00:11.666 --> 00:00:13.733
and they want to have a cool life.
过一种很酷的生活。

00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:17.000
The drivers here take it so much more seriously.
但这里的车手对比赛要认真得多。

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.133
In every single session,
每一个赛段，

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:20.233
the AM drivers are looking at the lap times,
AM级车手都会研究圈速，

00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:21.400
looking at the data,
分析赛车数据，

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.133
trying to figure out
努力找出，

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:25.000
where they can make their throttle inputs a little more precise.
哪些位置的油门输入还可以更加精准。

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.000
They're watching championships from around the world,
他们会关注世界各地的锦标赛，

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.733
as well as other GT championships,
也会研究其他GT赛事，

00:00:28.733 --> 00:00:31.366
to figure out how to become better at their craft.
从中钻研如何进一步提升驾驶技术。

00:00:31.366 --> 00:00:34.966
And no one in that category is more dedicated than Wang Yibo.
在这类车手中，王一博尤其投入。

00:00:34.966 --> 00:00:39.900
Just 12 months ago, he was still a driver getting used to the sport.
就在一年前，他还是一名尚在适应这项运动的车手。

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.200
Now he eats, breathes and sleeps motorsport.
如今，他的生活完全围绕着赛车运动。

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.866
He is absolutely hooked,
他已经彻底痴迷其中，

00:00:44.866 --> 00:00:46.600
and he wants to win this championship.
而且渴望赢得这项锦标赛。

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.600
Whether it's this year or next year,
无论是在今年还是明年，

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.800
he is absolutely determined and resolute.
他的目标都无比明确，决心也异常坚定。

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.500
He wants to become a China GT champion.
他希望成为China GT冠军。

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.466
So, as the fans make their voices heard in the stands,
此刻，看台上的车迷仍在高声呐喊，

00:00:55.466 --> 00:00:57.666
we get ready for the next encounter,
我们也准备迎接下一场较量，

00:00:57.666 --> 00:01:01.466
which is the second qualifying session.
也就是第二节排位赛。

00:01:01.466 --> 00:01:02.800
And the battle really is raging.
赛场上的争夺正愈演愈烈。
